T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cb1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42dfbb49-a6e3-4ab2-9ec0-330f07479cb1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"lintもいじれるようにしちゃうのかこれ","ts":"1631661185.274300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJY1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b62be14-e21d-448b-b4d0-bbde580e60ae","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"これかー\n\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11857|https://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11857\u003e","ts":"1631661090.273900","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11857|#11857 First pass at \"deno fmt\" config\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11857|#11857 First pass at \"deno fmt\" config\u003e","text":"Ref \u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/11686|denoland/deno#11686\u003e  \nRef \u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/discussions/11855|denoland/deno#11855\u003e\n\nAnalogous to adding configuration for `deno lint` I propose to allow configuring  \n`deno fmt` via a configuration file (and also using CLI flags as we don't want to have  \noptions in config file that are not available via CLI). I propose to start  \nwith minimal set of options; concretely allow only `useTabs` (that will help  \nwith the accessibility #3695), `tabWidth` and `singleQuote`\n\n```\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"jsxFactory\": \"h\"\n  },\n\n  \"lint\": {\n    \"files\": {\n      \"include\": [\"testdata/\"],\n      \"exclude\": []\n    },\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"tags\": [\"recommended\"],\n      \"include\": [\n        \"ban-untagged-todo\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"fmt\": {\n    \"files\": {\n      \"include\": [\"testdata/\"],\n      \"exclude\": []\n    },\n    \"rules\": {\n      \"useTabs\": true,\n      \"indentWidth\": 2,\n      \"singleQuote\": true,\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\nTo keep the same configurability in CLI I suggest to add `--rules-use-tabs`, `--rules-indent-width` and `--rules-single-quote` flags to `deno fmt` subcommand.\n\nSimilar to linter specifying CLI flags takes precedence over configuration in config file.\n\nAlternatives:\n\n• allow to configure only `fmt.files` and don't allow configuring rules,  \n    this would imply that we should switch default setting to use tabs instead  \n    of spaces to address #3695","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"feat, fmt","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"6","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1630063919}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/56"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c890657e-c853-4a01-b5a3-8cbb8548d6b1","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"`deno fmt`にオプションが追加されてフォーマットを調整できるようになったっぽいです カオスが生まれてしまうのか…？","ts":"1631660167.273500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f95e15ed-3544-4ceb-8c69-a2101718f497","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":":partying_face: Released v1.14.0 as scheduled\n\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/tag/v1.14.0\u003e","ts":"1631659919.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LeG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71f1e0e7-0ed5-4a5a-83a8-04098a7decb6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"問題として認識はしてるっぽいし気長に待とう","ts":"1631638165.271700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j6tI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d8b8d2f-1c81-4c65-9c77-c95b1f86d10f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"別のIssueに統合されたな","ts":"1631638147.271100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":f